      "arabic": "١١٣٤٥- سنا بنت سفيان\nالكلابية.\nيقال: إنها من اللاتي تزوجهن النبي ﷺ ولم يدخل بهن. ذكرها ابن سعد، وساق الاختلاف في اسم الكلابية، وسأذكر كلامه في ذلك في أول حرف العين.",
      "english": "11345 — Sana bint Sufyan\n\nAl-Kilabiyya.\n\nIt is said that she was among the women whom the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, married but with whom he did not consummate the marriage. Ibn Sa'd mentioned her and set forth the disagreement concerning the name of the Kilabiyya. I shall cite his discussion of that at the beginning of the letter ayn.",
